In `web/src/main/java/com/example/server/Server.java`, inside the `init` method, do not hardcode database credentials. Instead, retrieve them from a secure source like environment variables.

Replace the line:
```java
            conn = DriverManager.getConnection(DB_URL, "user", "");
```
with:
```java
            String dbUser = System.getenv("DB_USER");
